<title>UK: Clariant sets 456 mln Sfr convertible.</title>
<headline>Clariant sets 456 mln Sfr convertible.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clariant AG has issued a 456 million Swiss franc convertible bond due August 19, 2002, joint lead managers UBS and SBC Warburg said on Friday.</p>
<p>The deal pays a coupon of one percent per annum, with a 19.9 percent premium at an issue price of par. The conversion price is 1,140 Swiss francs.</p>
<p>There is a call after three years at par. --London newsroom,  +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
